<title>UK: Aluminium slumps on LME, reaction sets in.</title>
<headline>Aluminium slumps on LME, reaction sets in.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Staggers lower from early levels near Monday's 22-month high of $1,747. Falls under $1,720 at one stage as technical correction takes hold.</p>
<p>COPPER - Quiet, but drifting lower. Stocks continue to rise.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Easing in line with trend.</p>
</text>
